      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start, it's pretty clean. \n\nthough, looking at the score, it's only at 5. per the automated ranking, that's kind of on the low side for a \"comprehensive\" summary. the leads really like seeing more detail to feel confident that we haven't missed any sub-components of the work.\n\ncould you expand this a bit? try to capture more of the specific steps or sub-tasks involved in those items so the score is a bit higher. just please make sure they are still actually tasks the devs need to do, dont just add random filler.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
